WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.480 --> 01:44.180
=Episode 5=

01:57.933 --> 01:58.773
Chairman Gao?

01:59.853 --> 02:00.493
Let's chat?

02:06.174 --> 02:08.893
I heard Gao Haiming is collaborating
with Yunsheng,

02:09.733 --> 02:11.613
and requested you
to handle the business.

02:13.293 --> 02:14.693
That's correct.

02:15.334 --> 02:16.934
You're the second person to approach me.

02:18.334 --> 02:19.054
No surprise.

02:19.133 --> 02:21.494
Miss Xie came to see me before you.

02:22.534 --> 02:23.173
Alright.

02:24.173 --> 02:24.974
Hand it over.

02:25.733 --> 02:26.413
What?

02:26.534 --> 02:27.334
The check.

02:29.573 --> 02:31.453
Didn't you come here to give me a check

02:31.453 --> 02:32.774
to make me leave your son?

02:35.573 --> 02:36.733
How much do you want?

02:39.613 --> 02:41.534
You business moguls

02:42.654 --> 02:45.453
have such a limited approach
to problem-solving.

02:45.974 --> 02:49.254
Is marrying off your own son
the only way you can solve this problem?

02:50.214 --> 02:53.254
What does my son's marriage
have to do with you?

02:53.453 --> 02:54.814
Just tell me directly.

02:54.814 --> 02:56.054
How much money do you want?

02:58.814 --> 02:59.853
500,000?

03:01.094 --> 03:02.133
Five months.

03:03.374 --> 03:04.453
I need five months.

03:05.534 --> 03:07.133
Because the PR firm I work for

03:07.133 --> 03:08.974
is currently partnering with Letao.

03:09.293 --> 03:10.853
As the liaison,

03:11.054 --> 03:14.214
I'll inevitably have work interactions
with your son during these months.

03:14.413 --> 03:15.853
I'll be doing my job.

03:16.214 --> 03:17.254
No need for concern.

03:17.774 --> 03:21.013
Someone with his brilliant,
towering, perfect image

03:21.214 --> 03:22.814
is beyond my reach.

03:24.094 --> 03:25.853
But I need this job.

03:25.974 --> 03:27.214
Please understand.

03:27.573 --> 03:29.733
I need to make a living in this city.

03:31.094 --> 03:33.214
After that whole speech,

03:33.654 --> 03:36.654
you must want more than that, Miss Lin.

03:37.254 --> 03:38.853
Since I invited you into my car,

03:38.853 --> 03:41.293
it means this is a private conversation.

03:41.534 --> 03:44.453
Just speak plainly.

03:44.453 --> 03:46.334
Stop beating around the bush, okay?

03:48.934 --> 03:51.054
No wonder your son
avoids talking with you.

03:51.573 --> 03:52.934
You're way too paternalistic.

03:53.853 --> 03:54.613
Paternalistic?

03:57.453 --> 03:59.054
What paternalistic or maternalistic?

03:59.214 --> 04:01.013
I am his father, okay?

04:01.893 --> 04:02.453
True.

04:02.853 --> 04:04.173
Forget I mentioned it.

04:04.774 --> 04:06.374
(If I refuse the money,)

04:06.494 --> 04:09.254
(he'll think I have bigger plans
for Gao Haiming,)

04:09.374 --> 04:10.693
(making him more suspicious.)

04:10.693 --> 04:11.693
(Not worth the risk.)

04:12.254 --> 04:13.173
(I'd better)

04:14.733 --> 04:15.893
(take some cash)

04:15.893 --> 04:17.454
(and put the old man's mind at ease.)

04:17.574 --> 04:18.613
How much do you want?

04:18.613 --> 04:20.774
Does it really require
this much thought?

04:24.253 --> 04:24.933
5,000.

04:25.613 --> 04:26.574
5,000?

04:26.853 --> 04:28.454
If you think that's too much,

04:28.454 --> 04:29.534
we can negotiate.

04:32.933 --> 04:34.413
Is that okay?

04:35.733 --> 04:37.334
Well, this is unexpected.

04:38.774 --> 04:41.173
My son is worth

04:41.654 --> 04:43.654
just 5,000 to you?

04:43.933 --> 04:45.014
You misunderstood.

04:45.014 --> 04:46.813
He's not worth a penny to me.

04:50.184 --> 04:50.894
Here's the thing.

04:50.894 --> 04:52.053
Truth is,

04:52.334 --> 04:53.974
even if you hadn't come today,

04:54.613 --> 04:56.654
he probably wouldn't
give me a second look.

04:56.853 --> 04:58.373
But since you're wealthy

04:58.373 --> 05:00.613
and willing to share some generously,

05:00.774 --> 05:02.654
I should know my place.

05:03.094 --> 05:04.774
So whatever amount you offer...

05:05.774 --> 05:06.574
This heavy?

05:06.774 --> 05:08.253
Here's 50,000.

05:08.253 --> 05:10.134
Enough to buy your "knowing your place"?

05:11.134 --> 05:11.813
Is it enough?

05:11.813 --> 05:13.053
Yes. More than enough!

05:13.454 --> 05:14.253
No need to count it.

05:14.253 --> 05:15.053
No need to check.

05:15.053 --> 05:16.933
Every penny is there.

05:16.933 --> 05:17.613
Now, get out.

05:17.613 --> 05:18.253
Right away.

05:19.774 --> 05:20.534
Thank you.

05:20.974 --> 05:21.933
Just go.

05:22.774 --> 05:23.933
Take care, Chairman Gao.

05:33.654 --> 05:34.974
Leave the contract at Yunsheng.

05:35.214 --> 05:37.053
So Lin Huan'er must
deliver it personally.

05:37.574 --> 05:38.534
Then put on a show,

05:38.534 --> 05:40.813
so everyone thinks you're dating.

05:41.454 --> 05:43.413
When the chairman hears about it,

05:44.134 --> 05:46.574
he'll at least realize you have
zero interest in Miss Xie.

05:48.053 --> 05:49.534
Exactly as you planned.

05:50.053 --> 05:51.974
Brilliant, sir.

05:53.413 --> 05:55.613
You're sure Lin Huan'er got
into the chairman's car?

05:55.774 --> 05:57.574
Absolutely. Saw it with my own eyes.

05:57.733 --> 05:59.334
She was thrilled when she got off.

05:59.574 --> 06:00.774
Clearly, she took quite a bit.

06:04.613 --> 06:07.933
You said Lin Huan'er was special before.

06:08.733 --> 06:11.053
I don't see how she's different
from those gold diggers.

06:12.454 --> 06:14.373
But does she still hold
any value like this?

06:15.974 --> 06:18.134
It's fine. We both get what we want.

06:21.534 --> 06:23.694
Will you still go on the date
with Miss Xie?

06:24.173 --> 06:25.613
Of course, I'm going. Why not?

06:33.493 --> 06:35.654
Male Lead's fondness toward you
dropped again.

06:35.894 --> 06:37.574
Currently at negative 50%.

06:38.214 --> 06:39.334
(Dropped again?)

06:39.853 --> 06:41.253
(Alright.)

06:41.654 --> 06:43.454
(Let's see if you can
create more obstacles)

06:43.774 --> 06:45.173
(or if I have more tricks.)

06:51.053 --> 06:51.774
Hello.

06:52.493 --> 06:53.933
Hello. May I ask...

06:58.014 --> 06:58.933
Why are you here again?

07:00.774 --> 07:02.094
I'm here to spend money, okay?

07:02.774 --> 07:03.694
Okay.

07:04.094 --> 07:06.214
Just don't cause a scene like last time.

07:07.654 --> 07:09.413
I'd like someone to help
build the model.

07:18.094 --> 07:20.293
It's fine. You take the order, Haiming.

07:20.413 --> 07:21.373
I'm not picky.

07:22.014 --> 07:22.534
Okay.

07:26.053 --> 07:27.253
New Zealand King Salmon.

07:27.894 --> 07:29.053
Iberian white ham.

07:30.053 --> 07:31.094
Aged roast duck.

07:32.774 --> 07:33.974
Two almond milk puddings.

07:34.574 --> 07:35.813
And a bottle of La Tâche.

07:36.774 --> 07:37.293
Thank you.

07:37.293 --> 07:38.214
Okay. Just a moment.

07:43.454 --> 07:46.214
I saw your father's marriage
announcement about the alliance.

07:47.373 --> 07:49.574
He seems a bit too eager.

07:50.853 --> 07:51.853
He is indeed a bit eager.

07:52.454 --> 07:53.454
I hope you don't mind.

07:53.733 --> 07:55.293
Of course not, Haiming.

07:57.253 --> 07:58.253
Do you know?

07:58.493 --> 07:59.894
Back in school,

08:00.094 --> 08:01.774
you were always first place.

08:02.053 --> 08:03.493
And I was always second.

08:03.694 --> 08:05.334
That always made me so happy.

08:05.694 --> 08:06.413
Why?

08:07.454 --> 08:11.774
Because it made me feel like
you and I were together.

08:12.774 --> 08:14.733
No one was between us.

08:15.534 --> 08:17.774
We were one unit.

08:19.813 --> 08:22.813
Miss Xie, you really have
interesting thoughts.

08:24.134 --> 08:25.613
But work has been so busy.

08:25.733 --> 08:28.014
I've forgotten many things from before.

08:30.053 --> 08:32.853
That's true. Your father also told me

08:33.013 --> 08:34.974
that you are excellent in every way.

08:35.214 --> 08:38.094
It's just that your mind
is entirely on work.

08:38.773 --> 08:41.174
Well, you can't focus
on two things at once.

08:41.454 --> 08:43.013
How can you remember everything?

08:43.934 --> 08:45.493
But it's okay.

08:45.814 --> 08:48.174
Once the arranged marriage is announced,

08:48.334 --> 08:50.613
we'll be one unit.

08:51.414 --> 08:54.174
I'll help you remember things
from now on.

08:59.694 --> 09:00.493
You're right.

09:01.733 --> 09:02.893
A father knows his son best.

09:03.334 --> 09:05.013
I truly am focused entirely on work.

09:05.253 --> 09:06.574
I have no other thoughts for now.

09:11.013 --> 09:11.934
That's good.

09:29.613 --> 09:30.334
Miss Xie,

09:30.974 --> 09:32.414
Mr. Gao asked me to drive you home.

09:40.814 --> 09:41.533
Luo,

09:42.253 --> 09:45.373
what exactly is the relationship
between that Lin Huan'er and Mr. Gao?

09:47.893 --> 09:50.294
They have no relationship.

09:55.853 --> 09:57.094
Are you unwilling to tell me?

09:58.214 --> 09:59.814
They really have no relationship.

10:00.214 --> 10:01.613
Really no relationship?

10:01.893 --> 10:03.054
If they have no relationship,

10:03.174 --> 10:05.373
how could she just whisk Mr. Gao away
from the banquet?

10:05.533 --> 10:06.733
If they have no relationship,

10:06.733 --> 10:09.414
how could Mr. Gao negotiate a deal
with Yunsheng for her?

10:10.733 --> 10:11.853
Trying to hide it from me?

10:12.733 --> 10:14.133
I wouldn't dare.

10:14.814 --> 10:15.773
You know how it is.

10:16.414 --> 10:18.294
Even if Mr. Gao has
some connection with her,

10:18.533 --> 10:19.694
that's his private business.

10:19.974 --> 10:20.773
If he doesn't say,

10:21.013 --> 10:22.094
how could I dare to ask?

10:26.133 --> 10:27.294
Stop giving me excuses.

10:27.294 --> 10:28.893
You've been with him for so many years.

10:29.054 --> 10:30.694
There's no way you know nothing.

10:31.373 --> 10:32.934
I really don't know anything.

10:32.934 --> 10:33.773
Do you know?

10:36.934 --> 10:40.133
Then if I'll tell you,

10:40.613 --> 10:42.214
you can't tell anyone I told you.

10:54.253 --> 10:55.414
I knew it.

11:01.694 --> 11:02.414
Luo.

11:03.334 --> 11:04.814
From now on, whenever you have news,

11:05.094 --> 11:07.613
tell me first, okay?

11:09.013 --> 11:09.814
Don't worry.

11:10.133 --> 11:11.133
About today's matter,

11:11.133 --> 11:13.214
no one will ever know
it was you who told me.

11:16.294 --> 11:18.253
No need to drive me. Thank you.

11:36.174 --> 11:36.773
Mr. Gao,

11:37.414 --> 11:38.934
I told her everything as you asked.

11:41.853 --> 11:42.373
Yes.

11:45.454 --> 11:47.814
But it doesn't seem like
she intends to give up.

11:53.493 --> 11:55.214
Okay, got it.

11:59.493 --> 12:01.533
A flying kick. Flying kick.

12:03.334 --> 12:04.613
It's okay. Put in another coin.

12:05.214 --> 12:06.013
I'm done playing.

12:06.934 --> 12:08.133
Then let me just finish this.

12:09.974 --> 12:10.613
Almost done.

12:11.814 --> 12:13.974
Huan'er, do you remember
that back in school,

12:13.974 --> 12:15.814
Hu Tiehan was really good at this.

12:16.334 --> 12:18.574
Every time we died,
he was the only one still alive.

12:18.853 --> 12:20.414
Why are you always talking about...

12:22.133 --> 12:22.853
Hu Tiehan?

12:23.574 --> 12:24.214
(Wait.)

12:24.694 --> 12:27.533
(Did Hu Tiehan die in the line of duty
at the end of the novel?)

12:28.574 --> 12:30.253
(But isn't he a traffic cop now?)

12:31.934 --> 12:33.133
(What's wrong with my brain?)

12:33.133 --> 12:34.454
(I can't remember anything.)

12:36.853 --> 12:39.373
Why did you stop moving
at this crucial moment?

12:40.174 --> 12:41.294
Mengmeng, do you know...

12:41.653 --> 12:43.094
(I can't trigger a rule punishment)

12:43.094 --> 12:44.653
(for two fictional characters, right?)

12:44.773 --> 12:45.733
Know what?

12:46.814 --> 12:47.454
Nothing.

12:47.533 --> 12:48.360
(Only five chances.)

12:48.360 --> 12:49.013
What is it?

12:49.013 --> 12:50.152
(I'd better use sparingly.)

12:50.533 --> 12:51.733
(Otherwise, I'm done for.)

12:53.054 --> 12:54.934
Let's go. Didn't you say
you want to quit?

12:55.493 --> 12:57.454
Why do you always
leave your sentences hanging?

12:58.454 --> 12:59.214
Let's go home.

13:04.133 --> 13:05.294
What do you want me to know?

13:05.934 --> 13:07.214
Know what to have for dinner.

13:49.054 --> 13:49.974
It happens to be...

14:01.909 --> 14:06.664
(Yunsheng Tower)

14:08.694 --> 14:11.133
(This model has numerous
and complex parts.)

14:11.533 --> 14:12.934
(He assembled it so well.)

14:13.214 --> 14:14.613
(It shows he's very patient)

14:15.133 --> 14:17.414
(and willing to invest time
in his interests.)

14:18.094 --> 14:19.493
(I didn't expect that.)

14:33.574 --> 14:34.373
Mr. Gao?

14:35.493 --> 14:37.253
Why do you have this fighter jet model?

14:40.133 --> 14:41.013
That's strange.

14:41.013 --> 14:43.094
Has this fighter jet model
gone out of production?

14:43.253 --> 14:45.214
No. But you didn't assemble this.

14:45.653 --> 14:47.133
Why wouldn't it be me?

14:47.574 --> 14:50.613
Do you think I couldn't handle
such a precise model?

14:50.733 --> 14:52.893
Then how were
the ink wash stains removed?

14:56.533 --> 14:57.934
Some prefer using an eraser pen.

14:57.934 --> 15:00.334
But I prefer applying nitro varnish
several times first.

15:00.334 --> 15:01.613
This way is more foolproof.

15:01.974 --> 15:02.733
Any problem?

15:05.253 --> 15:06.334
That's odd.

15:06.733 --> 15:09.814
Why would you think
I didn't assemble this?

15:09.974 --> 15:11.214
Could someone really

15:11.214 --> 15:14.373
give away such
a painstakingly assembled model?

15:14.694 --> 15:15.414
Would they?

15:19.373 --> 15:20.174
Miss Lin,

15:20.974 --> 15:22.814
I came today to explain something.

15:22.814 --> 15:23.334
By the way,

15:24.094 --> 15:26.574
which of these three colors
do you find more appealing?

15:29.493 --> 15:30.533
How about we have a talk?

15:30.533 --> 15:32.334
This red one looks best.

15:33.094 --> 15:33.814
I'll use it.

15:35.373 --> 15:37.054
Destroying others' hard work like this

15:37.054 --> 15:38.174
isn't appropriate, Miss Lin.

15:39.613 --> 15:40.773
Others' hard work?

15:41.893 --> 15:43.814
You care deeply about others' hard work?

15:44.133 --> 15:46.694
Then tell me, does my proposal
count as my hard work?

15:52.533 --> 15:54.253
That's precisely what I came to explain.

15:56.414 --> 15:57.214
It's fine.

15:58.013 --> 15:59.013
No need to explain to me.

15:59.653 --> 16:01.334
I'm just thrilled to be recognized

16:01.334 --> 16:02.613
by a boss like you.

16:08.613 --> 16:10.694
Yes. This is exactly my proposal.

16:11.214 --> 16:12.013
Look closely.

16:14.174 --> 16:14.893
It's mine.

16:15.773 --> 16:16.334
The time?

16:17.094 --> 16:18.094
11:07.

16:18.493 --> 16:19.733
If I recall correctly,

16:20.013 --> 16:22.414
you arrived at Letao
in the afternoon, right?

16:25.214 --> 16:26.334
You're not implying...

16:26.334 --> 16:27.414
It may be hard to believe,

16:27.893 --> 16:30.013
but I completed it before you arrived.

16:30.653 --> 16:32.253
Both the concept and the approach

16:32.253 --> 16:33.334
were identical to yours.

16:34.133 --> 16:36.493
I apologize for not explaining earlier.

16:36.613 --> 16:38.054
But since we'll be collaborating,

16:38.533 --> 16:40.104
the misunderstanding shouldn't go on.

16:40.334 --> 16:41.694
So I want to explain to you.

16:44.613 --> 16:45.694
So that's how it is?

16:46.334 --> 16:47.414
So, Miss Lin,

16:47.454 --> 16:50.454
can we find a place to talk properly?

16:53.814 --> 16:56.773
Are you asking me out for business

16:57.493 --> 16:58.454
or a personal date?

17:01.054 --> 17:01.853
A personal date.

17:05.174 --> 17:05.894
Alright.

17:17.454 --> 17:19.134
(The first step to getting closer.)

17:19.253 --> 17:20.694
(Find common interests.)

17:20.733 --> 17:22.333
(Reduce psychological distance.)

17:25.013 --> 17:26.174
What can I get for you, sir?

17:27.454 --> 17:28.093
Miss?

17:30.013 --> 17:31.013
(I remember in the book,)

17:31.013 --> 17:33.813
(Gao Haiming likes a food
with a very peculiar name.)

17:34.414 --> 17:37.053
(I think it's called Angel Hair.)

17:38.454 --> 17:40.134
Miss Lin, what would you like to eat?

17:41.733 --> 17:42.654
Angel Hair.

17:46.974 --> 17:49.214
Will you have the same as Mr. Gao?

17:50.174 --> 17:50.694
Yes.

17:51.733 --> 17:53.013
The same, thank you.

17:55.974 --> 17:58.414
Miss Lin, how did you know
I'd order Angel Hair?

18:00.733 --> 18:02.214
I can read minds. Do you believe it?

18:04.093 --> 18:04.974
You don't believe it?

18:05.894 --> 18:07.053
Then why not let me try?

18:11.374 --> 18:14.293
You attract many admirers,

18:14.813 --> 18:16.333
and are loyal to those you care about.

18:17.134 --> 18:18.093
But...

18:18.614 --> 18:19.174
What?

18:21.454 --> 18:25.573
But you face some obstacles
in your career.

18:26.053 --> 18:28.253
Full of ambition
but with nowhere to apply it.

18:28.374 --> 18:29.374
Am I right?

18:31.053 --> 18:32.414
Miss Lin, you studied psychology?

18:35.654 --> 18:37.934
Then perhaps I should analyze you too?

18:39.374 --> 18:39.894
Alright.

18:41.093 --> 18:42.694
When you were analyzing me,

18:43.093 --> 18:45.733
your eyes unconsciously looked
to the upper left.

18:46.414 --> 18:47.614
Your eyebrows lifted slightly.

18:48.134 --> 18:50.053
That didn't seem like
on-the-spot analysis.

18:50.333 --> 18:53.093
It looked more like
you were searching your memory.

18:55.533 --> 18:57.093
Seems you came prepared.

18:58.974 --> 18:59.934
You own broad interests.

19:00.174 --> 19:02.253
But you only
scratch the surface of each.

19:04.053 --> 19:05.813
Mr. Gao, you studied psychology too?

19:06.894 --> 19:07.614
Just the basics.

19:18.894 --> 19:22.934
Angel Hair is actually very thin pasta.

19:24.093 --> 19:26.053
I just like its name.

19:26.533 --> 19:29.053
But in terms of taste, it can't beat
the classic versions.

19:30.333 --> 19:32.134
Falling for a dish

19:32.654 --> 19:33.894
just because of its name.

19:34.733 --> 19:36.854
Seems Mr. Gao is a romantic like me.

19:39.614 --> 19:41.934
I wonder if assembling models
for others is also romantic?

19:47.093 --> 19:49.134
So you admit that model
was assembled by me?

19:50.134 --> 19:52.134
I'm just curious how you recognized it.

19:53.333 --> 19:55.733
A tailor never fails
to recognize their own handiwork.

19:55.974 --> 19:57.454
Even the tiniest flaw

19:57.454 --> 19:58.733
is known only to them.

20:01.614 --> 20:03.414
Why picked me
to assemble that fighter jet?

20:04.654 --> 20:06.333
Shouldn't you tell me

20:06.333 --> 20:07.854
why you assembled jets for others?

20:13.214 --> 20:14.374
Since you can read minds,

20:14.374 --> 20:15.134
just take a guess.

20:19.093 --> 20:21.773
(Oh, no. What exactly did the book say?)

20:22.214 --> 20:23.493
(How would I know?)

20:24.733 --> 20:25.854
Your mind-reading failed?

20:26.654 --> 20:27.454
It doesn't matter.

20:28.694 --> 20:29.733
None of those matters.

20:30.573 --> 20:31.694
What matters is

20:31.894 --> 20:33.813
the moment I received that jet,

20:33.934 --> 20:36.533
seeing such an exquisite model

20:36.854 --> 20:38.813
made all the day's unhappiness vanish.

20:39.374 --> 20:40.454
It healed me.

20:40.854 --> 20:42.333
Though I didn't uncover

20:42.333 --> 20:43.854
why you assembled jets for others,

20:44.333 --> 20:45.214
I believe

20:45.654 --> 20:46.974
at least others' happiness

20:48.293 --> 20:49.694
makes your effort worthwhile.

20:51.813 --> 20:52.854
What more did you ask for?

20:56.694 --> 20:58.214
You always seem so happy.

20:59.414 --> 21:00.974
As a business elite,

21:01.614 --> 21:03.253
shouldn't you have more freedom?

21:08.614 --> 21:10.894
How could anyone have real freedom?

21:14.813 --> 21:16.454
But you have more freedom
than us, right?

21:16.773 --> 21:18.053
A fighter jet can fly far,

21:18.333 --> 21:19.134
but I can't.

21:19.733 --> 21:21.694
The bigger the empire,
the more constraints.

21:26.253 --> 21:27.013
You know nothing.

21:51.934 --> 21:53.573
Haven't you stared enough
during the meal?

21:55.333 --> 21:56.253
I'm thinking.

21:57.614 --> 21:59.208
The model jet you gave me

21:59.494 --> 22:01.614
is absolutely perfect and beautiful.

22:02.013 --> 22:04.333
I just don't know who to give it to.

22:05.854 --> 22:07.333
That requires careful thought.

22:10.053 --> 22:12.533
Sorry for taking up
your model-building time tonight.

22:14.174 --> 22:15.934
One day's delay is nothing. It's fine.

22:19.293 --> 22:22.454
But you seem very passionate
about PR work.

22:23.053 --> 22:24.533
Trying so hard to understand me

22:24.533 --> 22:25.733
just for a job?

22:27.894 --> 22:29.214
Now that the contract's secured,

22:29.214 --> 22:30.414
shouldn't you relax a bit?

22:32.813 --> 22:33.654
Relax?

22:34.614 --> 22:36.934
Mr. Gao, do you actually mean "give up"?

22:37.694 --> 22:39.174
We've only shared one meal,

22:39.174 --> 22:40.293
and you want me to give up?

22:41.214 --> 22:43.894
So you don't plan to give up.

22:44.894 --> 22:46.533
Do you think I should give up?

22:49.214 --> 22:50.694
I'll tell you next time we meet.

22:53.614 --> 22:54.174
Okay.

23:44.053 --> 23:45.573
How could I be so careless?

23:46.573 --> 23:47.333
Careless?

23:49.773 --> 23:51.533
Since you lives with Miss Zhu,

23:52.654 --> 23:55.293
you could get in even
without a key, right?

23:55.694 --> 23:56.454
Yes.

23:57.134 --> 23:58.174
Since you knew that,

23:58.174 --> 23:59.253
why return it to me?

23:59.773 --> 24:00.813
You started the verse.

24:02.053 --> 24:03.813
I couldn't let the stage
go cold, could I?

24:04.654 --> 24:05.214
Harsh.

24:05.614 --> 24:06.293
You too.

24:07.614 --> 24:09.333
Sir, another bowl of wontons, please.

24:15.253 --> 24:16.168
- Thanks.
- Your wontons.

24:25.934 --> 24:29.414
What? Can't handle hot wontons
with a Western palate?

24:31.253 --> 24:32.854
You seem to have quite the appetite.

24:33.533 --> 24:35.093
You treated me to Angel Hair.

24:35.374 --> 24:36.493
I treat you to wontons.

24:37.374 --> 24:38.333
It's like for like.

25:04.214 --> 25:05.013
Careful, it's hot.

25:10.174 --> 25:10.813
Is it good?

25:28.053 --> 25:32.053
(Wouldn't the fondness shoot
straight up to 50%?)

25:34.454 --> 25:35.813
It's just a set of keys.

25:36.614 --> 25:37.894
You could return them any time.

25:38.573 --> 25:41.253
Yet you chose to come back
specifically at night.

25:42.654 --> 25:44.533
Didn't you just ask me a question?

25:45.174 --> 25:46.974
Didn't you say you'd tell me next time?

25:47.454 --> 25:48.614
Isn't this "next time"?

25:54.854 --> 25:55.733
My answer is...

25:56.614 --> 25:57.214
Don't.

25:58.694 --> 25:59.454
Don't what?

26:09.293 --> 26:10.214
Don't give up.

26:45.813 --> 26:47.813
(Why isn't the fondness changing?)

27:07.974 --> 27:08.614
Mr. Gao.

27:09.333 --> 27:09.894
What's wrong?

27:10.374 --> 27:12.813
You've never had this expression
coming home before.

27:13.253 --> 27:14.053
What expression?

27:14.813 --> 27:17.493
Like you know you're going to win...

27:18.694 --> 27:19.894
Victory is assured...

27:20.053 --> 27:21.614
No, dead set on winning...

27:21.614 --> 27:22.733
What do you want to say?

27:23.614 --> 27:24.934
Don't get mad if I say this.

27:24.934 --> 27:25.493
Spit it out.

27:26.573 --> 27:27.454
Trying way too hard.

27:28.493 --> 27:30.773
Luo, why are you still in the company?

27:31.053 --> 27:33.053
Mr. Gao, I'm leaving right now.

27:33.773 --> 27:34.414
Good night.

27:57.573 --> 27:58.854
Decided to show your face, huh?

28:01.573 --> 28:02.333
Mr. Chairman.

28:05.293 --> 28:07.253
About the innovation
and R&D idea of yours,

28:07.253 --> 28:08.854
Uncle Li already told me.

28:09.694 --> 28:12.854
I waited up to hear your explanation.

28:13.013 --> 28:14.573
What exactly are you thinking?

28:17.934 --> 28:19.533
Mr. Chairman, you know it better.

28:19.974 --> 28:22.134
Letao's current strategy
is far too conservative.

28:23.093 --> 28:24.214
Bringing in foreign capital

28:24.214 --> 28:25.333
is selling out for peace.

28:25.333 --> 28:27.813
We'll never get the terms we want.

28:28.813 --> 28:30.414
I simply can't understand.

28:30.414 --> 28:32.934
There's a clear shortcut
right in front of us,

28:33.093 --> 28:35.813
yet you insist on taking
the long, muddy detour.

28:36.053 --> 28:36.934
Why?

28:38.093 --> 28:40.533
I don't consider marrying
into Fuchuang a shortcut.

28:42.253 --> 28:43.053
Gao Haiming,

28:44.654 --> 28:46.934
what right do you have
to look down on Fuchuang?

28:47.253 --> 28:49.573
Fuchuang is the biggest
domestic distributor now.

28:49.573 --> 28:50.614
It's a blessing

28:50.614 --> 28:52.533
that Wanjun looks your way, you know?

28:53.093 --> 28:55.293
Why else would Fuchuang choose
to partner with us?

28:55.654 --> 28:56.374
Mr. Chairman,

28:56.974 --> 28:59.134
Letao's crisis is born of this era.

28:59.253 --> 29:01.134
Our only way out is independent R&D.

29:01.134 --> 29:03.174
Don't give me that "era" nonsense!

29:03.174 --> 29:05.694
I'm telling you. There's only one way
for you to save yourself.

29:05.854 --> 29:08.174
Dump that unsavory woman immediately,

29:08.214 --> 29:09.333
and marry Wanjun.

29:09.333 --> 29:10.934
We'll discuss everything else later.

29:27.293 --> 29:28.008
Mom.

29:32.333 --> 29:33.414
Stay with me for a while.

29:35.134 --> 29:35.816
Okay.

29:49.134 --> 29:50.333
In my heart,

29:52.454 --> 29:53.733
I've always felt I failed you.

29:55.813 --> 29:59.293
When you were little,
your father and I both fell short.

29:59.813 --> 30:01.253
You've suffered enough.

30:02.214 --> 30:03.333
Now you're grown,

30:05.293 --> 30:06.773
and when it comes to marriage,

30:09.134 --> 30:11.253
I don't want you to compromise

30:11.253 --> 30:12.333
or make sacrifices.

30:13.654 --> 30:14.333
Marriage

30:18.174 --> 30:19.934
is far too important

30:21.694 --> 30:22.654
in a person's life.

30:26.573 --> 30:28.733
Don't you end up like me.

30:30.533 --> 30:32.253
Alright, Mom. I know.

30:36.813 --> 30:37.614
Remember this.

30:40.093 --> 30:41.614
Whatever you decide,

30:43.854 --> 30:45.214
whatever you want to do,

30:47.773 --> 30:48.894
I'll support you.

30:51.934 --> 30:52.533
Truly.

30:53.854 --> 30:55.214
I just want you to be happy.

30:56.293 --> 30:57.493
Just be happy.

30:59.454 --> 31:00.573
That's what matters most.

31:10.974 --> 31:12.854
Luo, follow up on this tomorrow.

31:13.333 --> 31:14.773
Please book a window seat for me

31:14.773 --> 31:16.493
for the Sky Garden
afternoon tea tomorrow.

31:33.573 --> 31:34.374
Archery.

31:35.813 --> 31:36.813
Can I try this?

31:36.813 --> 31:37.374
Sure.

31:37.374 --> 31:38.253
For the two of you?

31:38.253 --> 31:39.053
Yes, two of us.

31:39.293 --> 31:40.013
Thank you.

31:41.974 --> 31:43.374
- Let me see.
- Give it a try.

31:46.854 --> 31:47.454
Like this.

31:48.854 --> 31:49.854
Yes, wedge it in.

31:50.493 --> 31:51.333
Wedge it in.

31:53.934 --> 31:54.974
Arch your thumb.

31:54.974 --> 31:55.614
Thumb.

32:00.134 --> 32:00.733
I can't.

32:01.374 --> 32:01.974
It's too heavy.

32:01.974 --> 32:02.694
Maybe forget it.

32:02.952 --> 32:03.573
No way.

32:04.773 --> 32:05.733
Dare to make a bet?

32:08.493 --> 32:10.093
Let's see who's the better shot.

32:10.654 --> 32:11.854
Truth or Dare.

32:12.013 --> 32:14.013
The loser answers one question
from the winner,

32:14.333 --> 32:15.894
or does one thing the winner asks.

32:17.533 --> 32:18.174
Alright.

32:20.253 --> 32:21.013
You go first.

32:21.773 --> 32:22.374
I'll go first.

32:49.694 --> 32:51.253
Just a hair away from the bullseye.

32:53.134 --> 32:53.694
Your turn.

32:56.733 --> 32:58.293
You got skills and didn't say so.

33:03.733 --> 33:04.894
Hold it. Right.

33:05.733 --> 33:07.854
Then arch with your thumb.

33:08.293 --> 33:09.333
Arch your thumb.

33:22.888 --> 33:26.360
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

33:29.133 --> 33:32.290
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

33:33.733 --> 33:34.333
Arch it.

33:35.614 --> 33:36.214
Loose.

33:42.253 --> 33:43.293
Who gets credit for that?

33:44.053 --> 33:44.654
You win.

33:46.536 --> 33:51.271
♪I must escape this dream♪

33:52.584 --> 33:57.192
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

34:01.573 --> 34:02.333
Right here.

34:02.854 --> 34:04.214
We're eating right here?

34:04.694 --> 34:05.214
Yeah.

34:05.694 --> 34:08.334
You've never eaten
like this here before, right?

34:13.254 --> 34:13.934
Hold on.

34:20.894 --> 34:21.493
Sit.

34:30.013 --> 34:30.573
Here you go.

34:31.013 --> 34:31.533
Thanks.

34:40.093 --> 34:40.613
How is it?

34:43.374 --> 34:45.334
The coffee tastes quite unique.

34:45.734 --> 34:46.693
Unique is exactly right.

34:47.173 --> 34:48.533
I specially brewed this for you.

34:48.974 --> 34:50.653
This coffee's name is

34:51.093 --> 34:53.454
"Coffee on the Left Bank by the Seine,"

34:53.613 --> 34:54.854
"a cup in my hand, savoring..."

34:57.693 --> 34:58.693
The name's that long?

35:00.053 --> 35:00.734
You know nothing.

35:08.294 --> 35:09.414
So have you decided?

35:09.774 --> 35:11.493
Who should I give
my fighter jet model to?

35:14.814 --> 35:15.934
I thought about it.

35:20.934 --> 35:22.533
One shouldn't interfere in others' love.

35:23.334 --> 35:25.693
So you should make the choice yourself.

35:26.693 --> 35:28.454
But how can you count as others?

35:29.254 --> 35:31.213
You're practically an involved party.

35:31.213 --> 35:34.334
♪Timelines, tangled♪

35:34.334 --> 35:36.974
You know about this substance
called a catalyst?

35:37.854 --> 35:39.934
It doesn't undergo
chemical reactions itself.

35:40.934 --> 35:43.533
But it helps other substances react.

35:43.934 --> 35:46.133
Helping others assemble a fighter jet
is a catalyst too.

35:47.254 --> 35:48.934
But it doesn't interfere
in others' love.

35:52.854 --> 35:55.414
First time I heard someone
describe matchmaking so romantically.

35:56.774 --> 36:00.334
So, Mr. Gao, you only want
to be the catalyst in my love life

36:00.934 --> 36:02.254
and don't want to be part of it?

36:02.255 --> 36:09.515
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

36:11.414 --> 36:12.053
Hair's messy.

36:21.913 --> 36:24.896
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:26.105 --> 36:28.876
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:30.777 --> 36:36.690
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:38.487 --> 36:41.547
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:42.713 --> 36:46.165
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

36:47.161 --> 36:52.687
♪Until the world's end♪

36:55.097 --> 36:58.893
♪If I could♪

36:59.481 --> 37:02.297
♪Keep loving you♪

37:03.321 --> 37:05.721
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:05.721 --> 37:10.637
♪Beating together♪

37:11.609 --> 37:15.473
♪If I could♪

37:15.473 --> 37:18.713
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:19.769 --> 37:27.094
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

37:28.153 --> 37:31.097
♪Entwined worries linger♪

37:32.345 --> 37:35.097
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

37:36.953 --> 37:42.733
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

37:44.665 --> 37:47.690
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

37:48.935 --> 37:52.601
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

37:53.369 --> 37:59.216
♪Until the world's end♪

38:01.209 --> 38:05.113
♪If I could♪

38:05.721 --> 38:08.473
♪Keep loving you♪

38:09.529 --> 38:11.865
♪Hearing two hearts♪

38:11.865 --> 38:16.825
♪Beating together♪

38:17.817 --> 38:21.380
♪If I could♪

38:21.380 --> 38:25.081
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

38:26.073 --> 38:33.305
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
